{"title":"Berry/50","sourceTitle":"Berry/50/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>As estacas podem ser plantadas em qualquer tipo de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Soil\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Soil\">soil</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Soil\" title=\"Soil\"> </a></span> (não em terras agrícolas). Uma muda leva de 18 a 36 dias para se transformar em um arbusto jovem e mais 18 a 36 dias para se transformar em um arbusto maduro, ou um total de 4 a 8 meses<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Linha 65 de assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\plant\\fruitingbush.json</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115808\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 33/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 117/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.662      1 Template:Ll\n100.00%    0.662      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183790-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115808 and revision id 397409. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397409,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Berry%2F50%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:58:08.823Z"}